><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんぼうぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">文具；文房用品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108872\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>売店<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>文房具<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんぼうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在学校的商店里买了书具。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">文法</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんぽう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">文法；语法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83659\"><ruby>文法<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんぽう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なんかくそくらえだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">文法是多么可怕。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">文脈</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんみゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（段落的）文脉；思路；（事件、事态等的）背景；前因后果；来龙去脉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174696\"><ruby>言葉<rp>(</rp><rt>ことば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>意味<rp>(</rp><rt>いみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>文脈<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんみゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によって<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりうる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">语言的含义可以根据背景而改变。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">文明</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">文明；文化；文明（日本年号，1469—1487年）；文明年间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235867\">１９<ruby>世紀<rp>(</rp><rt>せいき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>白人<rp>(</rp><rt>はくじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>文明<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>時代<rp>(</rp><rt>じだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">19世纪是白人文明的时代。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分野</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">领域；范围；部门；分支</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113715\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>分野<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>草分<rp>(</rp><rt>くさわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在这个领域是草地。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分離</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分离；分割；脱离；隔离；孤立</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195190\">マヨネーズの<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>分離<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">麦当劳的油可以分开。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分量</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数量；分量；测量；称重</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分類</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分类；分门别类；整理分类</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104253\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>書類<rp>(</rp><rt>しょるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>分類<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他完成了文件的分类。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分裂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんれつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分裂；分割；破裂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124397\"><ruby>党派<rp>(</rp><rt>とうは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つに<ruby>分裂<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんれつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">党派分为两部分。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ブーツ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">靴；长靴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111106\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はブーツの<ruby>泥<rp>(</rp><rt>どろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をこすり<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把鞋子的泥落下来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ブーム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热潮；风潮；风尚；经济繁荣；景气；帆杆；吊杆；麦克风吊杆；话筒吊杆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146969\"><ruby>小型車<rp>(</rp><rt>こがたしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のブームは<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わろうとしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">小型汽车的泡沫即将结束。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">プラス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">加；加法；加上；正数；加号；正号；优点；好处；有利因素；正面效果；利润；收益；阳极；正极端子；正极；阳性（检测结果）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204386\">そんなことをしても<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のプラスにもならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这样做就不会有任何好处。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">プラスチック</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">塑料；塑胶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222959\">この<ruby>椅子<rp>(</rp><rt>いす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はプラスチックからできている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这把椅子是塑料做的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2915491\" title=\"Tatoeba · j0rd4nkzf\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · j0rd4nkzf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>"]